WEBVTT

1
00:00:08,660 --> 00:00:09,860
Weilan is not on the mission

2
00:00:09,860 --> 00:00:10,860
Almost falling

3
00:00:10,860 --> 00:00:11,860
The machine ran away

4
00:00:11,860 --> 00:00:12,860
You still have to fix it when you turn around

5
00:00:12,860 --> 00:00:13,860
That's extra work

6
00:00:13,860 --> 00:00:16,190
Why don't you really count?

7
00:00:16,190 --> 00:00:17,390
I'll let you easily accumulate papers

8
00:00:17,390 --> 00:00:19,590
If you have done too much repairing Weilan, you should find another solution.

9
00:00:19,590 --> 00:00:27,490
Has the inspection been completed? Is it qualified?

10
00:00:27,490 --> 00:00:30,690
Fire is the reward of light accumulation

11
00:00:30,690 --> 00:00:32,590
Salt and meat are your savilan

12
00:00:32,590 --> 00:00:34,890
Partitioning for additional settlement efficiency

13
00:00:34,890 --> 00:00:38,290
I didn't talk to you about these two items. If you do it, I will benefit from it.

14
00:00:38,290 --> 00:00:39,490
The rules here are very strict.

15
00:00:39,490 --> 00:00:40,990
But I won’t change the price after the work is done.

16
00:00:40,990 --> 00:00:44,210
If there is still a shortage of people in the future

17
00:00:44,210 --> 00:00:46,710
Tell me about the job and remuneration in advance and I can consider it.

18
00:00:46,710 --> 00:00:48,310
Don't talk about yourself like I beg you

19
00:00:48,310 --> 00:00:49,610
I only want people who can work
